cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata.
title: "The Hilbert--Pólya Operator and the Primitive Structure of the Complex
  Plane: Between F1, String Theory, and Ancient Geometry"
type: software
version: 1.8.0
date-released: 2026-04-11
authors:
  - family-names: González García
